Third-party JavaScript bundled with cloudg
==========================================

The HTML report (report.html) inlines Chart.js and D3 when
report.inline_js is true (the default), so the report works without
network access. Those two files are the unmodified builds published on
npm; their own licence headers are kept. The isometric map's two drawing
engines below have no CDN build and are always inlined.

